## Activity 3: Data Flow Investigation

### Customer Purchase Flow
```
Customer
   ↓
Browse Product Catalogue (filter/search by category)
   ↓
View Product Detail Page
   ↓
Add to Shopping Cart
   ↓
Checkout (Shipping Address + Payment)
   ↓
Order Processing (Order Number, Payment Status created)
   ↓
Database (Order + Customer + Product records linked)
   ↓
Order Tracking (Delivery Status updates to Customer)
```

### Admin Product Management Flow
```
Admin
   ↓
Login (Username + Password → Auth Token)
   ↓
Admin Portal / Dashboard
   ↓
Manage Product (Add / Edit Stock, Price, Category)
   ↓
Database (Product record updated)
   ↓
Reflected Live on Customer-Facing Catalogue
```

